{"text":"kuruntokai","n":170,"lines":["பலவும் கூறுகவஃ தறியா தோரே","அருவி தந்த நாட்குர லெருவை","கயனா டியானை கவள மாந்தும்","மலைகெழு நாடன் கேண்மை","தலைபோ காமைநற் கறிந்தனென் யானே"],"tr":["palavum kūṟukavaḵ taṟiyā tōrē","aruvi tanta nāṭkura leruvai","kayaṉā ṭiyāṉai kavaḷa māntum","malaikeḻu nāṭaṉ kēṇmai","talaipō kāmainaṟ kaṟintaṉeṉ yāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கருவூர்கிழார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Karuvūrkiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பலவும்","tr":"palavum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வும்","tr":"vum"}]},{"text":"கூறுகவஃ","tr":"kūṟukavaḵ","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுக","tr":"ṟuka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வஃ","tr":"vaḵ"}]},{"text":"தறியா","tr":"taṟiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தறி","tr":"taṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தோரே","tr":"tōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}],[{"text":"அருவி","tr":"aruvi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரு","tr":"aru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"தந்த","tr":"tanta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தந்","tr":"tan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"நாட்குர","tr":"nāṭkura","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குர","tr":"kura"}]},{"text":"லெருவை","tr":"leruvai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லெரு","tr":"leru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"}]}],[{"text":"கயனா","tr":"kayaṉā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கய","tr":"kaya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]},{"text":"டியானை","tr":"ṭiyāṉai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டியா","tr":"ṭiyā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"கவள","tr":"kavaḷa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவ","tr":"kava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ள","tr":"ḷa"}]},{"text":"மாந்தும்","tr":"māntum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாந்","tr":"mān"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தும்","tr":"tum"}]}],[{"text":"மலைகெழு","tr":"malaikeḻu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலை","tr":"malai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெழு","tr":"keḻu"}]},{"text":"நாடன்","tr":"nāṭaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டன்","tr":"ṭaṉ"}]},{"text":"கேண்மை","tr":"kēṇmai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேண்","tr":"kēṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"}]}],[{"text":"தலைபோ","tr":"talaipō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"}]},{"text":"காமைநற்","tr":"kāmainaṟ","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நற்","tr":"naṟ"}]},{"text":"கறிந்தனென்","tr":"kaṟintaṉeṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கறிந்","tr":"kaṟin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனென்","tr":"taṉeṉ"}]},{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பலவும்","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"pala","gloss":"many"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/and"}],"gloss":"even many things"},{"surface":"கூறுக","parts":[{"text":"கூறு","lemma":"kūṟu","gloss":"speak"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"let them speak"},{"surface":"அஃது","parts":[{"text":"அஃது","lemma":"aḥtu","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"அறியாதோரே","parts":[{"text":"அறியாதோர்","lemma":"aṟiyātōr","gloss":"those who do not know"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who do not know indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"aruvi","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"},{"surface":"தந்த","parts":[{"text":"தந்த","lemma":"தந்த","gloss":"brought"}],"gloss":"brought","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாள்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"fresh/day"}],"gloss":"fresh"},{"surface":"குரல்","parts":[{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"kural","gloss":"bud/shoot"}],"gloss":"buds"},{"surface":"எருவை","parts":[{"text":"எருவை","lemma":"eruvai","gloss":"eruvai grass"}],"gloss":"eruvai grass"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கயனா","parts":[{"text":"கயனா","lemma":"கயனா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டியானை","parts":[{"text":"டியானை","lemma":"டியானை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவள","parts":[{"text":"கவள","lemma":"கவள","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"மாந்தும்","lemma":"மாந்தும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"கெழு","parts":[{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṇ","gloss":"male pronominal suffix"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"},{"surface":"கேண்மை","parts":[{"text":"கேண்மை","lemma":"kēṇmai","gloss":"friendship/love"}],"gloss":"friendship"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"end/limit"}],"gloss":"end"},{"surface":"போகாமை","parts":[{"text":"போ","lemma":"pō","gloss":"go"},{"text":"காமை","lemma":"kāmai","gloss":"negative verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"not reaching"},{"surface":"நற்கு","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"adverbial suffix"}],"gloss":"well"},{"surface":"அறிந்தனென்","parts":[{"text":"அறிந்தனென்","lemma":"அறிந்தனென்","gloss":"I knew"}],"gloss":"I knew","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"}]}],"literal":"Many things let them speak, those who do not know that. / The waterfall-brought fresh-budded eruvai grass, / the deep-pool-seeking elephant eats as mouthfuls, / of the lord of the mountain-rich land, the friendship / not reaching an end, well I knew, I indeed.","translation":"Let those who do not understand speak as many things as they please. I know very well that my love for the lord of the mountainous land—where elephants seeking deep pools feed on mouthfuls of fresh eruvai grass brought down by the waterfalls—will never come to an end.","modern":"விஷயம் தெரியாதவர்கள் பலவற்றையும் பேசட்டும். அருவி அடித்துக் கொண்டு வந்த புதிய மொட்டுகளையுடைய எருவைப்புல்லை, குளத்தைத் தேடிச் செல்லும் யானை கவளமாக உண்ணும் மலைநாட்டினுடைய தலைவனின் நட்பு, ஒருபோதும் முடிந்துபோகாது என்பதை நான் நன்றாகவே அறிந்துள்ளேன்.","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine, expressing her absolute confidence in the hero's love to her friend or to herself in response to the gossip of the villagers. She asserts that those who gossip do not understand the depth of their bond. The poem is set in the Kurinji landscape, which symbolizes union and deep intimacy. The image of the elephant seeking a deep pool and eating the fresh eruvai grass brought by the waterfall represents the hero seeking the heroine and enjoying her love, which is constantly nourished by natural, life-giving forces. The key words are 'கேண்மை' (friendship/love) and 'தலைபோகாமை' (not ending), emphasizing the eternal nature of their bond despite any external gossip.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}